        <li><code>/tonight</code> + <code>/tonight.json</code> — <strong>PointCast Tonight.</strong> GO OUT / STAY IN: an official-source weekly entertainment guide around El Segundo with outings, municipal television signals, canceled-program notation, approximate distance bands, a visible source-access ledger, and a candidate-only robots-aware refresh script.</li>
